<div class="content-wrapper"><div class="content-header"><div class="container-fluid"><h1 class="m-0"><i class="fas fa-warehouse mr-2"></i>Almacenes</h1><p class="text-muted mb-0">Maestro de ubicaciones donde se controla inventario, reservas y entregas.</p></div></div><div class="content"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="alert alert-light border"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt mr-1"></i>Un almacén solo puede desactivarse cuando no tiene stock, reservas, lotes con saldo ni documentos comerciales abiertos.</div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="card card-primary"><div class="card-header"><h3 id="warehouse-form-title" class="card-title">Nuevo almacén</h3></div><div class="card-body"><form id="warehouse-form"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save"><input type="hidden" name="id"><div class="form-group"><label>Código</label><input name="code" class="form-control" maxlength="30" placeholder="ALM-SUR" required></div><div class="form-group"><label>Nombre</label><input name="name" class="form-control" maxlength="150" placeholder="Almacén Sur" required></div><div class="form-group"><label>Dirección</label><input name="address" class="form-control" maxlength="300"></div><div class="d-flex"><button class="btn btn-primary flex-grow-1" type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save mr-1"></i><span>Crear almacén</span></button><button id="warehouse-form-cancel" class="btn btn-outline-secondary ml-2 d-none" type="button">Cancelar</button></div></form></div></div></div><div class="col-md-8"><div class="card"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Almacenes registrados</h3></div><div class="card-body table-responsive"><table id="warehouse-table" class="table table-bordered table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Código</th><th>Nombre</th><th>Dirección</th><th>Stock / reservado</th><th>Documentos abiertos</th><th>Estado</th><th>Acciones</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
